<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  p, li { font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 15px; }
  td, th { padding: 8px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Course Information</h2>
  <p>Graphic Design 1: Computer Graphics</p>
  <p>ARTG <span data-field="course_number">{{ course_number }}</span>, CRN <span data-field="crn">{{ crn }}</span>, Section <span data-field="section">{{ section }}</span> (<span data-field="semester">{{ semester }}</span>)</p>
  <p>Class Hours: <span data-field="class_time">{{ class_time }}</span>, Room <span data-field="room">{{ room }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Instructor Contact Information</h2>
  <p>Instructor: <span data-field="instructor_name">{{ instructor_name }}</span></p>
  <p>E-mail: <span data-field="instructor_email">{{ instructor_email }}</span></p>
  <p>Office: <span data-field="office_location">{{ office_location }}</span></p>
  <p>Office Hours: <span data-field="office_hours">{{ office_hours }}</span> or by appointment</p>
  <p>Office Phone: <span data-field="office_phone">{{ office_phone }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Instructor Information</h2>
  <p><span data-field="instructor_bio">{{ instructor_bio }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Course Description</h2>
  <p><span data-field="course_description">{{ course_description }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Course Prerequisite Information</h2>
  <p><span data-field="prerequisites">{{ prerequisites }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Course Objectives</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="objective_1">{{ objective_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="objective_2">{{ objective_2 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Course Outcomes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="outcome_1">{{ outcome_1 }}</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Required Course Materials</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Sketch book</li>
    <li>Pencils</li>
    <li>Eraser</li>
    <li>Ruler</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Required Software</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Adobe Photoshop</li>
    <li>Adobe Illustrator</li>
    <li>Adobe InDesign</li>
  </ul>

  <p><strong>Note:</strong> <span data-field="software_note">{{ software_note }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="software_purchase_info">{{ software_purchase_info }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Grading Criteria</h2>
  <p>Graphic Design 1: Computer Graphics is designed around three modules.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Illustrator</li>
    <li>Photoshop</li>
    <li>InDesign</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Specific grades are applied as follows:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The Illustrator module exercises and assignments</li>
    <li>The Photoshop module exercises and assignments</li>
    <li>The InDesign module exercises and assignments</li>
  </ul>

  <p><span data-field="grading_policy">{{ grading_policy }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Evaluation Standards: Critical Thinking and Problem Solving</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="standard_1">{{ standard_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="standard_2">{{ standard_2 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Design</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><span data-field="design_1">{{ design_1 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="design_2">{{ design_2 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="design_3">{{ design_3 }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="design_4">{{ design_4 }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Attendance Policy</h2>
  <p><span data-field="attendance_policy">{{ attendance_policy }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="excused_absence_policy">{{ excused_absence_policy }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="late_arrival_policy">{{ late_arrival_policy }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Grading Consequences</h2>
  <p><span data-field="grading_consequences">{{ grading_consequences }}</span></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2>Grading Scale</h2>
  <p>A final letter grade will be assigned at the end of the term, based upon the total possible points according to the following scale:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A 90-100 Superior: <span data-field="grade_a">{{ grade_a }}</span></li>
    <li>B 80-89.99 Average: <span data-field="grade_b">{{ grade_b }}</span></li>
    <li>C 70-79.99 Average: <span data-field="grade_c">{{ grade_c }}</span></li>
    <li>D 60-69.99 Below Average: <span data-field="grade_d">{{ grade_d }}</span></li>
    <li>F Below 60 Unacceptable Performance: <span data-field="grade_f">{{ grade_f }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Course Calendar</h2>
  <p><span data-field="calendar_info">{{ calendar_info }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Time Management</h2>
  <p><span data-field="time_management_info">{{ time_management_info }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="time_management_advice">{{ time_management_advice }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Plagiarism/Academic Dishonesty Statement</h2>
  <p><span data-field="plagiarism_statement">{{ plagiarism_statement }}</span></p>

  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #ccc; margin: 20px 0;">

  <h2>Disabilities Statement</h2>
  <p><span data-field="disability_statement">{{ disability_statement }}</span></p>
  <p>If you have a documented disability and require specific accommodations, you will need to contact the Disabled Student Services Office in the East Union Bldg., Room 106 with in the first two weeks of classes. The Disabled Student Services Office can also be reached in the following ways:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Web: <span data-field="disability_web">{{ disability_web }}</span></li>
    <li>Phone: <span data-field="disability_phone">{{ disability_phone }}</span> or TTY</li>
    <li>Fax: <span data-field="disability_fax">{{ disability_fax }}</span></li>
    <li>E-mail: <span data-field="disability_email">{{ disability_email }}</span></li>
  </ul>
</div>